<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's BT bank has higher '96 net.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's BT bank has higher '96 net.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque de Tunisie, one of the largest banks in Tunisia, said it made a 8.095 million dinars net profit in 1996, up from 6.475 million dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>The state-controlled bank'S balance sheet amounted to 985.429 million dinars and its total capital was 58.878 million dinars at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>($=1.08 dinar)</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
